RDGTXZ,	DCA	RDHDBN 		/ AND LOADED FLAG

RDEXIT,	ISZ	RDGETR		/ BUMP UP TO RETURN			/A003
RDEXI2,	ISZ	RDGETR		/ EXIT FROM ABOVE ALSO			/A030
