	TAD I	GTHDRS		/ GET ADDR OF HDR CTL BLK		/M045
	CIA			/ COPLEMENT FOR COMAPRE			/A003
	TAD	(RDBFCB)	/ ADD IN READ FILE HDR CTL BLK		/A003
	SNA CLA			/ IF NOT READ ONLY, DO SCROLL READ	/A003
/D045	JMP	RDGTHR		/ GO READ READ ONLY HEADERS		/A003
/D045	JMS	SCGETR		/ GO GET HEADER BLOCK NBR
