	TAD I	GTHDRS		/ GET ADDR OF HDR CTL BLK		/A040
	CIA			/ COPLEMENT FOR COMAPRE			/A040
	TAD	(RDBFCB)	/ ADD IN READ FILE HDR CTL BLK		/A040
	SNA CLA			/ SKIP IF: SCROLL READ 			/A040
	JMP	GTHDC1		/   READ ONLY FILE, IGNORE GTP		/A040
