/D047	IFDEF	STATLN	<						/A043

	JMS	SCBOTP		/ GO BUMP UP POINTERS BY ONE		/A043
	1			/ NUMBER TO BUMP UP BY			/A043

/D047			>	/ END IFNDEF STATLN			/A043
