	SCBTHT				/ HDR PTR			/A003
	SCBOTT				/ HDR WORD PTR			/A003
SCALCZ,	0				/ DISPLACEMENT AMOUNT		/A003
	ISZ	SCALC			/ ARE WE DONE?			/A003
	JMP	SCALCX			/ NO GO DO IT AGAIN		/A003
