/									/A042
/			The CURRENT SCTOP and HDR ID # (SCTPH)		/A042
/			     are in the caller's data field		/A042
									/A042
/D042	TAD	SCTOP		/CURRENT TOP POINTER			/A042
/D042	SWP			/MQ = CURRENT TOP			/A042
	ACL			/AC = POINTER TO CALLERS SAVE AREA	/A042
